{
  "$comment": "Harmless prank library (never aimed at a body, belongings, private info; no fake emergencies; nothing anyone could trip over). target = interactable id. setup: seconds of visible fiddling (evidence while doing it; heat = how conspicuous). delay: seconds until the effect can surface. effect.kind maps to code in sim/pranks.ts. trigger (generic pranks): projector | board | laptop | near | class (teacher present and idle) | timer. at: spot where the teacher deals with it. distraction: seconds the teacher is busy (cover for other mischief). followUp: second teacher task. riskWindow: seconds after setup in which loitering at the spot or the teacher passing it matters. opinions: trait (>= 0.5) -> classmate affinity change (positives keep quiet). snitchMul scales snitching. combo: when a lesson phase rule is active (e.g. dim = film/presentation) the effect surfaces at once and the distraction is multiplied.",
